# =============================================================================
# .gitignore - ECE-574 AXI4-Lite Formal Verification (Synopsys VC Formal)
# Commit: RTL, properties, scripts, docs, and the small text reports in results/.
# Ignore: tool databases, logs, waveforms, compile outputs, OS/editor junk.
# =============================================================================

# ---- VC Formal / VC Static run databases --------------------------------------
vcst_rtdb/
.vcst_rtdb/
vcst_*/
vc_static_*/
*.vcst
.fml*/
fml_*/
*_rtdb/

# ---- VCS / compile outputs (VC Formal compiles with VCS front end) ------------
csrc/
simv
simv.daidir/
simv.vdb/
*.daidir/
.vcsmx_rebuild
AN.DB/
64/
work/
*.so
*.o
ucli.key
vc_hdrs.h
partitionlib/

# ---- Verdi / waveform viewer ---------------------------------------------------
verdiLog/
verdi_config_file
novas.rc
novas.conf
novas_dump.log
novas.fsdb
*.fsdb
*.vpd
*.vcd
*.wlf
DVEfiles/
.restartSimSession.tcl.old
*.rc.bak

# ---- Logs and temp files -------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.log.*
*.key
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
*.swp
*.swo
nohup.out
core
core.*

# ---- Keep the small report files we DO want in the repo ----------------------
# (report_fv output saved as .txt under results/, CEX screenshots, bug matrix)
!results/
!results/**/
!results/**/*.txt
!results/**/*.png
!results/**/*.csv
!results/**/*.md

# ---- OS / editor junk ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
